WEBVTT

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:08.810
I can't fight Kusanagi.

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:12.660
I knew he couldn't fight Kusanagi.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.240
For Playmaker, Kusanagi is family.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.620
No, more than family!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.330
They've fought together as one.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.370
This is horrible!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.340
What will you do, Playmaker?

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.580
Will you lose for your friend?

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:39.620
I'll end you next turn.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.360
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:09.150
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:16.470
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:23.040
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:29.790
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:37.020
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:43.730
I want to share your pain

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:16.850
Playmaker's acting weird.

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.930
Like he doesn't want to make a move.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:23.800
Playmaker can't make a move?  
Who is this opponent?

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.930
If you look closely, he's 
emitting a strong aura!

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:30.530
What?  An avatar can emit an aura?

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:33.140
It can!  Watch!

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:38.720
Wow, Boss!  That's your aura?

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.640
No, it's a fart!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.870
What should we do, Playmaker?

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.160
I don't know.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.810
Prepare yourself, Playmaker.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.320
No one's coming to help you.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:55.280
Only one of us can survive this duel!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.890
Kusanagi...

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.960
Bring it, Playmaker.

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:03.060
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:06.430
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Link Satellite!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:14.370
For every one of Decode Talker's Link 
Markers, I place a Satellite Counter on this card.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:18.840
As long as I have Link Satellite, 
we can't attack each other.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:22.050
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:25.780
Now, I remove a counter from Link Satellite.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:30.020
When there are no more counters, 
this card is destroyed.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:34.320
Playmaker is stalling?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.260
You disappoint me.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:39.000
He's safe for two turns.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:42.100
But when it's over, he's once again...

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:46.550
Damn!  If it wasn't for this 
barrier, I can help him!

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:50.310
But I can only watch this cruel duel!

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:56.980
Playmaker.  If you can't 
fight me, that's good for me.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:02.200
To be honest, I don't care about 
the fight between AIs and humans.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:09.090
Even if the humans lose and the world is 
in trouble, I only care about my brother.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:12.560
As long as I get him back, I'm satisfied!

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.530
Kusanagi...

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:22.260
Shoichi Kusanagi is behaving like expected.

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:26.500
Playmaker is torn.  How fun.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.140
Jin...

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:34.260
I failed to protect you not once, but twice.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.600
Forgive me, Jin.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:44.210
If you won't attack me, I'll 
end you this turn like I said!

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:47.240
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:50.500
I summon Codebreaker Zero Day from my hand!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.580
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:07.120
I set Codebreaker Zero Day and Link 2 
Virus Swordsman in the Link Markers!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.690
Link Summon!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:13.040
Link 3 Codebreaker Virus Berserker!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.930
He has a Link 3!

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:24.740
When Virus Berserker is Special 
Summoned to be co-linked...

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:29.820
...I select up to two Level 4 or lower 
Codebreakers in my hand or graveyard.

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:35.610
And I Special Summon them in defense 
position on your field next to Decode Talker's links.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.670
Come out, Codebreaker Zero Day!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:46.710
Decode Talker gains 500 ATK for 
every monster next to its links.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:50.030
However, Codebreaker Zero Day's effect!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.450
Reversal Force!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:06:00.320
Decode Talker lost 500 ATK again!

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:01.840
I know!

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:06.890
I activate the Continuous Trap, 
Codebreak Backfire's effect!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:12.950
When a Codebreaker is Special Summoned 
on your field, you take 600 damage!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.800
Bad!  This is bad!

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.100
We only have 1200 LP left!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:26.360
Two more effect damage hits 
and we'll lose all our LP!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.370
As you wish, I'll use effects to erode you.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.760
Virus Berserker's effect!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:38.800
For every Codebreaker on your field, I can 
destroy your faceup spell or trap card!

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:43.250
For every destroyed card, 
you take 600 damage!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.550
I destroy Link Satellite!

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:52.490
That was supposed to protect Playmaker!

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.230
This is bad!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.880
Stop hesitating, Playmaker!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:08.640
It's too bad.  I didn't expect 
it to end like this between us.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.920
But don't be mad at me.

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:14.110
I made my decision from the start.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:19.370
On which is more important: 
Justice or my brother.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.050
Kusanagi...

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.290
You forget that you said that?

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.900
Justice...  What's important...

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:38.370
If you don't remember, you'll lose!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.890
Lightning!  Bohman!

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.750
This isn't fair, Lightning!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.250
What do you mean, Ai?

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:58.570
We're just steadily moving towards our goal.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:02.730
A failure like you has no 
reason to look down on us.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.170
Stop messing around!

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.400
What are you doing?

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.440
Playmaker only has 600 LP.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.730
Hurry up and end him.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:17.080
Yeah, I know.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.710
Kusanagi!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.110
Battle!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:26.490
Codebreaker Virus Berserker 
attacks Decode Talker!

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:29.850
If this attack succeeds, Playmaker loses!

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:31.820
Playmaker...

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.340
I activate the trap, Link Cancel!

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:39.680
I return Decode Talker to the Extra Deck!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:45.840
I Special Summon the monsters I 
used to Link Summon Decode Talker!

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:50.530
I Special Summon Link Spider 
and Protocol Gardna!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:59.150
Due to Protocol Gardna's effect, you 
can't attack monsters next to its links!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:02.710
But I can attack Protocol Gardna!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:07.930
Here I go!  Virus Berserker 
attacks Protocol Gardna!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.660
Seriously?

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:17.370
Playmaker...

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.540
It's over.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.080
What?

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.210
Playmaker...

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.500
We're still okay!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:41.030
Once per turn, Protocol Gardna isn't 
destroyed in battle, and battle damage becomes 0.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.300
So you survived.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:47.270
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Codebreak Bind!

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:51.700
If your monster that's 
linked to a Codebreaker

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:55.510
destroys my monster in battle 
and sends it to the graveyard...

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.100
...I can send this card to the graveyard to

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:01.980
deal you damage equal to 
the monster's original ATK.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.720
I end my turn.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:10.720
If Kusanagi's monster is destroyed, 
Playmaker will run out of LP.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:11.690
It's over.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.280
Why's he tired?

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:20.130
That's not just damage from the duel.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:22.370
It's damage to his spirit.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:27.470
The pain of fighting a friend 
is eating away at Playmaker.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.940
Playmaker...

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:35.200
What's wrong?  Tired already?

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.420
These are the skills of the 
duelist I chose as my partner?

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.120
Stop with the needless chatter.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.960
This duel is practically over.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:51.500
Let me have fun in the end.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:11:00.940
Playmaker, you'll vanish without fulfilling 
the promise you made with me at this location.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:04.600
This location...  Promise...

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.200
That's right.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:19.760
Yusaku.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.060
Where's Ai?

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:26.170
I left him at home, as you asked.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:30.500
Good.  I wanted to talk to you alone.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.970
Talk about what, Kusanagi?

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.710
I want you to make me a promise.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:37.910
Promise?

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:38.800
That's right.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:43.060
Promise that no matter what, 
you'll carry out justice.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.680
What do you mean?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.910
The final battle will soon begin.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:50.150
But they still have Jin.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:54.060
I'm sorry.  It's because 
I'm not strong enough.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.060
No, that's not what I'm saying.

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:00.670
During the Lost Incident, 
I failed to protect Jin.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:06.070
If I stayed more by his side, maybe 
he wouldn't have gotten involved.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:10.070
It's my fault he's on a painful path.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:17.620
When Jin was rescued, I promised I'd 
never leave him alone again.  But...

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:23.990
Lightning will do anything to win.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:33.460
As long as they have Jin, I expect them to 
use him as a hostage and make outrageous demands.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:37.250
Meaning they'll have me fight you?

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.040
That won't happen.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:42.970
Stop it, Yusaku.  You know it's true.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.480
You can't talk them out of this.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.480
And don't you run from it.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:53.440
If it happens, I can't abandon Jin.

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:56.560
I'll probably choose to fight you.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.740
So don't hesitate to defeat me.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.290
Kusanagi!

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:07.690
Yusaku, I teamed up with you so 
that I could save my brother.

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:11.770
I can't abandon him.  But you're different.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.840
I'm the same as you!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.370
Because I wanted to settle 
things with myself!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.600
No, it's different now.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:21.110
You're the guide for everyone's future.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.710
Playmaker represents hope.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.130
You may be a fugitive in LINK VRAINS.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:35.480
But on the net, everyone 
knows you saved LINK VRAINS.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.960
I'm only connected to Jin.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.070
But you're connected to everyone.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.380
Playmaker is a hero!

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:51.280
Instead of choosing to save us, you 
must choose to defeat Lightning!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:57.010
Playmaker should forget his own 
desires and carry out justice!

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.330
Kusanagi, you really want it your way.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.190
Yeah.  I do.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.930
But I'm counting on you.  Promise me.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.200
Only you can save this world.

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.770
Playmaker...

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.810
Playmaker!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.520
Are you okay?

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.430
Playmaker...

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.390
What?

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.790
Here I go!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:50.070
Playmaker, you...

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.710
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:57.310
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:02.750
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Effect Monsters!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:08.590
I set Link Spider and Link 2 Protocol 
Gardna in the Link Markers!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.060
Link Summon!

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:18.080
Appear!  Link 3 Extended Decode Talker!

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:28.170
What's this?  No way...

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:29.910
That's...

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:33.560
Playmaker's new Decode Talker!

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:36.410
A new ace monster.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:40.030
So you've decided to move forward, Playmaker.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:42.890
Extended Decode Talker's effect!

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:48.360
For every monster next to 
its links, it gains 500 ATK!

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.660
Power Integration!

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:52.070
Codebreaker Zero Day's effect!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.200
Reversal Force!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.970
Not again!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:04.960
Due to Codebreak Bind's effect, it can't 
attack unless it's linked to a Codebreaker.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:11.260
He summoned it there so it could 
attack, but it lost too much ATK.

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:16.380
I activate the spell 
card, Decode Destruction!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:24.130
Extended Decode Talker gains 500 ATK 
for every monster its linked to!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:30.300
Extended Decode Talker attacks 
Codebreaker Virus Berserker!

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:32.840
Playmaker!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.430
He's finally attacking?

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:41.550
But Extended Decode Talker has 
lower ATK than Virus Berserker!

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:46.150
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Cyberse Pride from my hand!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:50.490
My Cyberse can't be destroyed 
in battle this turn!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:55.640
And when your battling monster's ATK 
are greater than my monster's...

00:16:55.640 --> 00:17:00.460
...by paying LP equal to the difference, 
their ATK become the same!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:13.580
Kusanagi, I'll keep the 
promise I made with you!

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:18.040
But if Virus Berserker is 
sent to the graveyard...

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:23.050
...due to Codebreak Bind's effect, 
Playmaker will run out of LP.

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.760
Decode Destruction's additional effect!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:31.730
The monster that Extended Decode 
Talker destroyed is banished!

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.630
What?

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:38.600
Now Codebreak Bind's effect doesn't activate!

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:43.570
Due to their own effect, Codebreakers 
Zero Day are destroyed.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.910
Decode Destruction's effect!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:53.150
After the battle, all cards 
on your field are destroyed!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.890
Well done.

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:02.360
Since Zero Day is destroyed, 
Reversal Force's effect is gone!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.800
Extended Decode Talker's effect!

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:15.140
When a monster next to its link is 
destroyed, it can attack twice in battle this turn!

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:24.090
Yusaku...

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.440
I leave the rest to you.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.750
Sorry, Jin.

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.060
Kusanagi!

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.250
Kusanagi!

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.720
Kusanagi...

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.370
Playmaker!

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.060
Kusanagi!

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.240
The analysis is almost done!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:26.210
When it's done, we should 
be able to contact Revolver.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.920
Pull yourself together, Playmaker!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:39.610
Playmaker, how does it feel 
to defeat your friend?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:42.330
Hey, stop that!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.330
Don't you know sympathy?

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:50.660
Sorry, but I have no intention of 
understand something like that.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.470
You!

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:58.910
Playmaker, you couldn't 
save your dearest friend.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:05.290
He vanished, disappointed that you 
couldn't protect a simple promise.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:09.290
You won't create the 
future.  You're no savior.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:14.800
You can't accomplish a single 
thing.  You're foolish and weak.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:20.160
We beat you without even 
having to battle you.

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:23.630
No, you're wrong.

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:28.000
Playmaker...

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:32.610
What?  It's not like you to be a sore loser.

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:39.580
Kusanagi knew you'd use a hostage 
to blackmail him into battle.

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.320
What?

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:50.080
So Kusanagi promised to entrust me 
with the future when this day arrived.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:52.680
That I would carry out justice!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.500
They made that promise?

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:59.110
He predicted my actions?

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.970
Lightning, what do you want with me?

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:07.980
Oh my.  You don't know why I called you here.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.980
I didn't expect Playmaker's 
partner to be so dumb.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:15.650
He tricked me.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:19.410
Kusanagi doesn't hate me.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:22.440
He was proud of me!

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.100
You're the ones who lost!

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:34.740
Playmaker!

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.330
Playmaker!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.120
Soulburner...

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.360
Lightning!  Bohman!

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:57.090
You stomped on someone you 
absolutely shouldn't have!

